---
title: Chicken Flautas
source: Matt
servings: 4
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 20 minutes
---

In a #medium bowl{}, mix @cooked chicken{2%cans}, @shredded cheddar cheese{} and @salsa{} together.

Scoop the mixture into @tortillas{} and roll up, securing with toothpicks.

Heat @oil{} in a #frying pan{} and fry each tortilla until brown on each side, about ~{5%minutes} per batch.

Serve hot with @guacamole{}, @avocado slices{} and more!
